  "behavior": "`Select.Root` and `Combobox.Root` give a form their value with its line breaks, as a `<select>` gives the value of its option with no change. They give the value in `type=\"hidden\"` inputs, which keep each line break. `new FormData(form)` and a submission thus have the value of the part. Base UI submits the value without its line breaks.",
